&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Você quer mudar a forma como o mundo cria?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Na Formlabs, estamos construindo as ferramentas que possibilitam que qualquer pessoa dê vida às suas ideias, desde produtos inovadores até dispositivos médicos que salvam vidas. Nossa tecnologia de impressão 3D impulsiona a inovação em mais de 50.000 líderes da indústria em todo o mundo, incluindo Apple, Google, Tesla, New Balance e NASA. Juntos, estamos ajudando todos a projetar, prototipar e fabricar mais rápido do que nunca.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Somos uma equipe &quot;mão na massa&quot; formada por construtores, engenheiros e inovadores reinventando como o mundo fabrica objetos físicos. Se você está pronto para moldar o futuro da fabricação, venha construir isso com a gente.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resumo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Estamos em busca de profissionais dedicados e proativos para nos ajudar a manter nossa produção de impressão 3D funcionando perfeitamente. Neste cargo, você trabalhará no chão de fábrica, onde usamos impressoras 3D avançadas para fabricar peças para clientes do mundo todo. Nenhuma experiência prévia com impressão 3D é necessária — nós ensinaremos tudo o que você precisa saber.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Descrição do Cargo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Como &lt;strong&gt;Operador(a) de Produção (Impressão 3D)&lt;/strong&gt;, você ajudará a operar máquinas, dar acabamento em peças impressas, verificar a qualidade e preparar os produtos para envio. Você terá um papel fundamental para garantir que os pedidos sejam concluídos no prazo e com excelência. Esta é uma posição de tempo integral (horista) em nossas instalações de alta tecnologia, onde você terá a oportunidade de aprender e fazer um rodízio entre diversas estações práticas de produção.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilidades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operar impressoras 3D e outros equipamentos de produção (oferecemos treinamento).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Limpar, dar acabamento, inspecionar e embalar peças impressas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seguir rigorosamente os padrões de qualidade e procedimentos de segurança.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manter a organização e a limpeza da sua área de trabalho.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabalhar em equipe e comunicar-se de forma clara com os supervisores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auxiliar no cumprimento das metas diárias de produção.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisitos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiência anterior em manufatura, logística (armazenagem) ou funções similares é um diferencial, mas não é obrigatória.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forte atenção aos detalhes e capacidade de seguir instruções.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacidade de trabalhar de forma independente e eficiente após o treinamento.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilidade em lidar com um ambiente dinâmico e acelerado, com disposição para ajudar onde for necessário.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambiente de Trabalho e Exigências Físicas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabalho em ambiente de manufatura com exposição ao ruído de máquinas, variações de temperatura e materiais particulados.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacidade de permanecer em pé, caminhar e trabalhar na área de produção por longos períodos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacidade de levantar e mover objetos pesando até 22 kg (50 libras) conforme a necessidade.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefícios e Vantagens&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plano de saúde abrangente pela UMR (através da rede United Healthcare).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cobertura oftalmológica e odontológica inclusas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contas de poupança saúde e flexíveis (FSA/HSA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Funcionários horistas em tempo integral acumulam horas de folga remunerada (PTO) a partir da data de início, podendo chegar a até 3 semanas (120 horas) por ano.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefícios de deslocamento / Vale-transporte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefícios de fertilidade e Licença parental.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefícios de saúde e bem-estar (academia).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planejamento financeiro / Previdência privada (401k).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refeições e lanches - almoço fornecido pela empresa 3x na semana.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impressão 3D ilimitada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mesmo que você não preencha todos os requisitos, mas sinta que pode contribuir, por favor, candidate-se.&lt;/strong&gt; Ajude-nos a construir uma comunidade inclusiva que mudará o futuro da impressão 3D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;At Formlabs, base pay is one part of our total compensation package and is determined within a range. Your base pay will depend on your skills, qualifications, experience, location and expected impact on the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The hourly base pay range for this role is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$20 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

felicis-verkada:greenhouse:5044895007.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is transforming how organizations protect their people and places with an integrated, privacy-sensitive AI-powered platform that includes solutions for video security, access control, air quality sensors, alarms, intercoms, and visitor management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve got serious momentum in the market: more than 30,000 customers (including 100+ of the Fortune 500), &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnbc.com/2025/12/03/verkada-capitalg-valuation-security.html&quot;&gt;a $5.8B valuation&lt;/a&gt;, more than $1 billion in annualized bookings, and backing from CapitalG, Sequoia Capital, General Catalyst, Felicis Ventures, Next47 and more. Physical AI is one of the most consequential technology shifts of our time, and Verkada is at the center of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;285&quot; data-end=&quot;302&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;731&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Regional &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;Sales Manager (People Leader)&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll play a critical role in scaling Verkada’s regional channel business by leading and developing a high-performing team of Regional Channel Sales Managers (CSMs). You’ll be responsible for driving consistent, above-quota performance through strategic partner engagement, pipeline discipline, and strong executive relationships across Verkada’s Regional Partner ecosystem across the West.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;733&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;first-line manager leadership role &lt;/strong&gt;that blends strategy with hands-on execution. You’ll work closely with senior sales leadership, cross-functional teams, and key partners to accelerate growth in a fast-paced, high-impact environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;973&quot; data-end=&quot;990&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1148&quot;&gt;You’ll lead from the front, empowering your team to build pipeline, close complex deals, and deepen strategic partner relationships. Here’s what you’ll own:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1150&quot; data-end=&quot;1411&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1150&quot; data-end=&quot;1192&quot;&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Develop a High-Performing Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1192&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;Lead, mentor, and coach a team of around 6–8 Regional Channel Sales Managers to achieve individual and team quotas. Recruit, hire, onboard, and develop top channel talent while supporting underperformers through to success across the West region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1454&quot;&gt;Drive Pipeline &amp;amp; Forecast Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;Support and coach CSMs in building pipeline daily, maintaining strong pipeline hygiene, and delivering accurate forecasts. Conduct weekly forecast calls and pipeline reviews to ensure consistent execution and visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1679&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1679&quot; data-end=&quot;1717&quot;&gt;Execute National Channel Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Partner with the Head of National Channel Sales to execute Verkada’s national channel strategy, ensuring alignment between partner initiatives, regional execution, and company-wide GTM priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1918&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1918&quot; data-end=&quot;1956&quot;&gt;Support Complex, High-Value Deals:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;1959&quot;&gt;Assist CSMs in closing highly complex transactions by developing executive-level relationships with key national and regional partners. Provide deal strategy, escalation support, and executive alignment when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2176&quot; data-end=&quot;2395&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2176&quot; data-end=&quot;2210&quot;&gt;Operational Rigor &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2210&quot; data-end=&quot;2213&quot;&gt;Monitor sales activity, pipelines, forecasts, and closed deals across the team. Report on performance, trends, and risks to senior leadership with clear insights and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2397&quot; data-end=&quot;2618&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2397&quot; data-end=&quot;2431&quot;&gt;Enable Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2431&quot; data-end=&quot;2434&quot;&gt;Coordinate and lead weekly and monthly one-on-one meetings, team trainings, and pipeline reviews to drive skill development, best-practice sharing, and ongoing performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2620&quot; data-end=&quot;2839&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2620&quot; data-end=&quot;2655&quot;&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2655&quot; data-end=&quot;2658&quot;&gt;Work closely with Sales, Marketing, Enablement, and Operations to support partner initiatives, drive demand generation, and ensure your team has the tools and support needed to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2841&quot; data-end=&quot;3019&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2841&quot; data-end=&quot;2878&quot;&gt;Lead in a Fast-Paced Environment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2878&quot; data-end=&quot;2881&quot;&gt;Deliver results in a high-growth, high-expectation sales culture while modeling accountability, resilience, and customer-first leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot; data-start=&quot;2841&quot; data-end=&quot;3019&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role requires regular travel, estimated&amp;nbsp;to be more than 50%&amp;nbsp;of the time, including both domestic and international destinations as needed. The successful candidate must be comfortable with frequent travel to support business operations, customer and partner&amp;nbsp;engagements&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;team collaboration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3021&quot; data-end=&quot;3038&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3040&quot; data-end=&quot;3189&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3040&quot; data-end=&quot;3068&quot;&gt;Proven Sales Leadership (5yrs+):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3068&quot; data-end=&quot;3071&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success leading high-performing sales teams, with channel sales leadership experience strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3343&quot; data-end=&quot;3485&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3343&quot; data-end=&quot;3372&quot;&gt;Consistent Sales Success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3372&quot; data-end=&quot;3375&quot;&gt;Strong personal and team track record of sales achievement; President’s Club or similar recognition is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3487&quot; data-end=&quot;3623&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3487&quot; data-end=&quot;3526&quot;&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Forecasting Strength:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3526&quot; data-end=&quot;3529&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage high-volume transaction environments and accurately forecast results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3625&quot; data-end=&quot;3796&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3625&quot; data-end=&quot;3648&quot;&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3648&quot; data-end=&quot;3651&quot;&gt;Excellent presentation, listening, and communication skills with the ability to influence executive-level stakeholders internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3798&quot; data-end=&quot;3961&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3798&quot; data-end=&quot;3820&quot;&gt;Strategic Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3820&quot; data-end=&quot;3823&quot;&gt;Ability to develop and execute top-down and bottom-up strategies with national partner leadership that drive measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3963&quot; data-end=&quot;4093&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3963&quot; data-end=&quot;3982&quot;&gt;Talent Builder:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3982&quot; data-end=&quot;3985&quot;&gt;Proven success hiring, training, and developing sales talent while coaching teams through change and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3191&quot; data-end=&quot;3213&quot;&gt;Channel Expertise is a huge plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3213&quot; data-end=&quot;3216&quot;&gt;Existing relationships and/or prior leadership experience within SaaS, physical security, or partner-led sales organizations is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4095&quot; data-end=&quot;4263&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4095&quot; data-end=&quot;4117&quot;&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;4117&quot; data-end=&quot;4120&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Based in or near a major city in the Bay Area. Expected to work in-office with flexibility and travel approximately 50% across the West region.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Employee Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is committed to fostering a workplace environment that prioritizes the holistic health and wellbeing of our employees and their families by offering comprehensive wellness perks, benefits, and resources. Our benefits and perks programs include, but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare programs that can be tailored to meet the personal health and financial well-being needs - Premiums are 100% covered for the employee under at least one plan and 80% for family premiums under all plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nationwide medical, vision and dental coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Saving Account (HSA) with annual employer contributions and Flexible Spending Account (FSA) with tax saving options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanded mental health support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave policy &amp;amp; fertility benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to relax and recharge through our paid holidays, firmwide extended holidays, flexible PTO and personal sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fertility Stipend&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness/fitness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy lunches provided daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be independently authorized to work in the U.S. We are unable to sponsor or take over sponsorship of an employment visa for this role, at this time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;C9DxTc &quot;&gt;Annual Pay Range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Verkada, we want to attract and retain the best employees, and compensate them in a way that appropriately and fairly values their individual contribution to the company. With that in mind, we carefully consider a number of factors to determine the appropriate starting pay for an employee, including their primary work location and an assessment of a candidate&#39;s skills and experience, as well as market demands and internal parity. A Verkada employee may be eligible for additional forms of compensation, depending on their role, including sales incentives, discretionary bonuses, and/or equity in the company in the form of restricted stock units (RSUs)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below is the annual on-target earnings (OTE) range for full-time employees for this position, comprised of base compensation and commissions (if applicable).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Estimated Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$185,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$260,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verkada Is An Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, Verkada is committed to providing employment opportunities to all individuals. All applicants for positions at Verkada will be treated without regard to race, color, ethnicity, religion, sex, gender, gender identity and expression, sexual orientation, national origin, disability, age, marital status, veteran status, pregnancy, or any other basis prohibited by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your application will be handled in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.verkada.com/privacy/candidate-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://url.uk.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/E_spClO3Ac9pX43h9dXa8/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1719327847319000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw10eB41dX5dzNP9yveIJLsf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

felicis-verkada:greenhouse:5139539007.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
