&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is currently seeking an experienced Occupational Therapist, OT, for a full, part or prn time opportunity completing home health visits for our Davidson County Visits office.&amp;nbsp; This position services adult and geriatric patients on a per visit basis in homes throughout Chatham and Lee counties in North Carolina.&lt;/p&gt;
