&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, what’s the role all about?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;As a Database Reliability Engineer (DBRE), with &lt;strong&gt;8-12 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; you will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining robust automation and reliability solutions that support the stability and performance of our data platforms within our Azure SaaS environment. You will work closely with&amp;nbsp;Platform Engineering, SRE, Cloud Operations, and R&amp;amp;D teams to implement tools and frameworks that ensure seamless scaling, proactive monitoring, and self-healing of data services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Your mission is to bridge the gap between database engineering and site reliability, ensuring our cloud-native offerings are resilient, secure, and capable of efficient development on a scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Own availability, reliability, scalability, and performance of production and non‑production database platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Design,&amp;nbsp;operate, and&amp;nbsp;optimize DynamoDB, AWS RDS (PostgreSQL), Aurora, and Amazon OpenSearch environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Implement and automate backup, restore, high availability, and disaster recovery strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Lead investigation and resolution of database‑related incidents and contribute to post‑incident reviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with Platform Engineering and SRE to define standards and best practices for database lifecycle management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Enable secure and scalable self‑service data platform workflows for application teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Perform performance tuning, capacity planning, and query optimization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Build and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;observability for data platforms using metrics, logs, and&amp;nbsp;alerting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Automate provisioning and operations using Infrastructure as Code tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with security, regulatory, and data governance requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you got what it takes?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;AWS (RDS, Aurora, IAM, Networking, Monitoring)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Amazon OpenSearch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Time‑series databases&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Kubernetes (EKS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Terraform /&amp;nbsp;OpenTofu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Prometheus, Grafana,&amp;nbsp;OpenTelemetry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;CI/CD and&amp;nbsp;GitOps&amp;nbsp;pipelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will have an advantage if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of OpenSearch or similar search technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Background in time‑series data platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience working in regulated or compliance‑driven environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Kubernetes‑native database operation experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;CI/CD skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;AWS experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At NiCE Actimize, you will work on mission‑critical platforms that protect the global financial system. You will be part of a strong Platform Engineering organization focused on automation, reliability, and developer experience, with opportunities to grow technically and professionally while making real‑world impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Enjoy NiCE-FLEX! &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At NiCE, we work according to the NiCE-FLEX hybrid model, which enables maximum flexibility: 2 days working from the office and 3 days of remote work, each week. Naturally, office days focus on face-to-face meetings, where teamwork and collaborative thinking generate innovation, new ideas, and a vibrant, interactive atmosphere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
